TYPE LIBRARY

LIBRARY  EWDB_APPLICATIONS

SUB_LIBRARY sta_maint

LOCATION THIS_FILE

LINK_NAME Details
LINK ../station_maintenance/station_maintenance.html#sta_maint

DESCRIPTION <b>sta_maint</b> is one of a collection of tools developed
to manage station metadata in an Earthworm database.  <b>sta_maint</b>
modifies station metadata in an Earthworm database based upon commands
read from a flat file.  The flat file is generally written by <b>sta_display</b>
and then modified by a user, to affect the desired changes.
Please see the details page for more information.
